{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51908","headline":"商山馆（商山馆中窗颊上有八句诗云云，不知何人作。净君、凉友，是帚与扇明矣。） · 无名氏","name":"商山馆（商山馆中窗颊上有八句诗云云，不知何人作。净君、凉友，是帚与扇明矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"净君扫浮尘，凉友招清风。\n炎炎火云节，萧然一堂中。\n谁知鹿冠叟，心地如虚空。\n虚空亦莫问，睡起照青铜。\n（《清异录》三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}